                if (the cad distance from cropPointer to cropDragStart) > 0.000001:
                    set changedCrop to the bim crop dragCrop dragged at handle cropDragHandle by cropDelta
                    begin bim transaction in (the address of editor's documentValue)
                    store bim view changedCrop in (the address of editor's documentValue's current)
