                        set editedElevation to the bim elevation of level editedMesh's levelId in editor's documentValue's current
                        set hitFace to the bim face of mesh editedMesh through (a cad vector3 with x hitSpot's x, y hitSpot's y and z (hitSpot's z - editedElevation))
