                        set toPixel to the bim view point (hitSpot's x + faceNormal's x) (hitSpot's y + faceNormal's y) (hitSpot's z + faceNormal's z) in viewLayout with camera
                        set meshPushStep to a cad vector2 with x (toPixel's x - fromPixel's x) and y (toPixel's y - fromPixel's y)
