                set hitPoint to a cad vector2 with x (sideRay's origin's x + (sideHit's distance * sideRay's direction's x)) and y (sideRay's origin's y + (sideHit's distance * sideRay's direction's y))
                set massFound to the bim sketch index of sideHit's id in editor's documentValue's current
