                            set toPixel to the bim view point (hitPoint's x + sideNormal's x) (hitPoint's y + sideNormal's y) hitZ in viewLayout with camera
                            set meshPushStep to a cad vector2 with x (toPixel's x - fromPixel's x) and y (toPixel's y - fromPixel's y)
